WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.133
Running an organization means a thousand moving parts...

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:07.067
and many of them still run on paper.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.600
Your team has more work than hours.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.667
And to most people, AI just writes stiff, buzzword-filled emails.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.567
What if AI did the busywork, and your people did the thinking?

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.167
Meet Claude, an AI assistant.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.133
Teach it your handbook and policies once, and your whole team can use it.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Snap a photo of a paper form,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.833
and Claude turns it into a clean spreadsheet.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.933
Claude builds a custom survey for everyone in your organization,

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.567
reads every answer, and gives you clear steps to improve.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:50.133
Claude works right inside Slack, and connects to Gmail and Google Drive.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.733
Tag it in a thread, and it answers right there.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.967
Need something found?

00:00:56.267 --> 00:01:00.867
Claude searches the web and your files, and brings back what you asked for.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.200
You bring the creative ideas.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:10.000
Claude follows the guidelines you set, and the final send is always yours.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.533
Kingdom Sites sets it up for your team,

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:18.700
so AI does the heavy lifting and your people get their time back.
